{
 "goal": "Ask *what* and *who*: 这是什么？ 他是谁？",
 "extra": ["名字", ["小明", "Xiǎomíng", "Xiaoming (a name)"]],
 "blocks": [
  {"text": "Questions with 什么 (shénme, *what*) and 谁 (shéi, *who*) keep the normal word order. The question word goes exactly where the answer will go, not to the front as in English and German."},
  {"pattern": "他是谁？ → 他是我朋友。", "english": "Who is he? → He's my friend."},
  {"ex": [
   ["这是[什么]？", "Zhè shì [shénme]?", "What's this?"],
   ["你说[什么]？", "Nǐ shuō [shénme]?", "What did you say?"],
   ["你要[什么]？", "Nǐ yào [shénme]?", "What do you want?"],
   ["他是[谁]？", "Tā shì [shéi]?", "Who is he?", "谁 is also said shuí. The audio says shuí."],
   ["[谁]知道？", "[Shéi] zhīdào?", "Who knows?"],
   ["你找[谁]？", "Nǐ zhǎo [shéi]?", "Who are you looking for?"]
  ]},
  {"h": "The answer goes in the same place"},
  {"ex": [
   ["你叫[什么]名字？", "Nǐ jiào [shénme] míngzi?", "What's your name?", "Literally *You're called what name?*"],
   ["我叫[小明]。", "Wǒ jiào [Xiǎomíng].", "I'm called Xiaoming."]
  ]},
  {"h": "什么 + noun"},
  {"text": "什么 also goes before a noun: 什么东西 *what thing*, 什么问题 *what question*."},
  {"ex": [
   ["这是[什么]东西？", "Zhè shì [shénme] dōngxi?", "What (thing) is this?"],
   ["你有[什么]问题？", "Nǐ yǒu [shénme] wèntí?", "What's your question?"]
  ]},
  {"h": "Whose: 谁的"},
  {"ex": [
   ["这是[谁的]钱？", "Zhè shì [shéi de] qián?", "Whose money is this?"]
  ]},
  {"h": "No 吗, no moving"},
  {"text": "什么 and 谁 already make a question, so there's no 吗."},
  {"wrong": [
   ["什么这是？", "Shénme zhè shì?", "The question word stays where the answer goes: 这是什么？"],
   ["这是什么吗？", "Zhè shì shénme ma?", "Already a question: no 吗."]
  ]}
 ],
